'''''Eurhynchiastrum pulchellum''''' is a species of [[moss]]es belonging to the family [[Brachytheciaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Eurhynchiastrum Ignatov & Huttunen |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/4898622 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=24 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref> It is the sole species of the genus '''''Eurhynchiastrum'''''.

The species is found in temperate to arctic environments in Africa, Eurasia and America.<ref name="eflora">{{cite web |title=Eurhynchiastrum in Flora of North America @ efloras.org |url=http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=1&taxon_id=317903 |website=www.efloras.org |access-date=24 November 2021}}</ref> 

